---
import RulePage from "../components/RulePage.astro";
---

<RulePage
  slug="scalability"
  description="How will your application handle more traffic, meaning more business, and what options match the build you have now?"
  prompt="Review this app for /scalability. How will it handle more traffic, meaning more business? Look at how and where it is hosted, and give me options that match the current build."
  subtitle="How do I know my app will work in the wild when customers start to use it?"
  lead="This skill is about how your application will handle an increase in traffic. More business. It reviews how and where the app is hosted, and gives options that match your current build."
  issues={[
    "More customers would mean more traffic, and you do not know what breaks first.",
    "You cannot say how the app is hosted, or where it runs.",
    "The current host fits today, and you have no next option when the business grows.",
    "A busy hour would stack the work in one place, with nowhere for it to go.",
    "The options in front of you do not match the stage the build is actually at.",
  ]}
/>
